WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:11.136
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will talk about our IT Consulting and Support service.

2
00:00:11.424 --> 00:00:26.112
Growing businesses face many technology decisions: which software to buy or build, how to keep data secure, and who fixes things when they break.

3
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:33.144
Our consulting and support service gives you an experienced technology partner.

4
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.648
Let us look at the problems first.

5
00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:42.168
Uncertainty about which technology or vendor to choose.

6
00:00:42.456 --> 00:00:48.192
No in-house team to maintain business-critical software.

7
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.376
Repeated downtime and slow resolution of issues.

8
00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:57.864
And security and backup gaps in the systems.

9
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.704
This service includes all of this.

10
00:01:01.992 --> 00:01:09.432
Technology strategy and a digital transformation roadmap based on your business goals.

11
00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:15.912
An architecture review of your code, infrastructure and technology stack.

12
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:20.760
Regular maintenance, bug fixes and improvements.

13
00:01:21.048 --> 00:01:25.656
Uptime monitoring, alerts and automatic backups.

14
00:01:25.944 --> 00:01:30.408
Security audits, access reviews and hardening.

15
00:01:30.696 --> 00:01:39.480
And technical support by phone, email and WhatsApp, Monday to Saturday, 9 AM to 7 PM.

16
00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:48.984
Here is how support works. The monitoring dashboard shows the health of all your systems.

17
00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:56.856
If a server or application has a problem, an alert and a support ticket are created immediately.

18
00:01:57.144 --> 00:02:03.624
Our team diagnoses and fixes the issue, and posts a full update on the ticket.

19
00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.536
Our approach, in five steps.

20
00:02:07.824 --> 00:02:15.048
A discovery session to understand your goals, current systems and pain points.

21
00:02:15.336 --> 00:02:22.536
Assessment: a review of code, infrastructure, security and processes.

22
00:02:22.824 --> 00:02:29.760
Roadmap: prioritized recommendations based on effort and impact.

23
00:02:30.048 --> 00:02:36.504
Implementation: putting the roadmap into practice together with your team.

24
00:02:36.792 --> 00:02:43.104
And ongoing support with proactive maintenance and fast issue resolution.

25
00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:53.664
We work with Docker, GitHub Actions, Node.js, PostgreSQL, monitoring tools and cloud hosting.

26
00:02:53.952 --> 00:03:02.544
And even if your software was built by another team, we can audit it and take over maintenance.

27
00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.304
The benefits.

28
00:03:05.592 --> 00:03:10.128
Confident decisions on technology investments.

29
00:03:10.416 --> 00:03:14.016
Less downtime through proactive monitoring.

30
00:03:14.304 --> 00:03:19.488
Safer systems through security reviews and backups.

31
00:03:19.776 --> 00:03:25.632
And a dedicated team that knows your systems well.

32
00:03:26.328 --> 00:03:39.864
Choosing new software, taking over existing software, reviewing security and backups, planning a cloud migration, or arranging annual maintenance.

33
00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:49.368
Our team supports SMEs, manufacturing, healthcare, education, retail and startups.

34
